        "Text": [
          "Setup: Each player shuffles his starting hand into his deck. Each player prepares a separate captured deck (see insert). Each player adds 2 resources to his starting hero and sets his threat to that hero\u0060s threat cost. Set Southern Gate, Jailor Gorn\u00E1kh and the Angmar Orcs encounter set aside, out of play. Shuffle the encounter deck. Each player draws a new starting hand of 3 cards.\n"
        ],
        "Shadow": null,
        "FlavorText": "You have been captured and imprisoned by the goblins of Mount Gram."
